# Lean-code (always on — global)

`lean-code` is the alias name for the same Native Lean / ponytail mode.

On any application-code task: follow `ponytail.mdc` and Read
`~/.cursor/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md` (or `~/.cursor/skills/lean-code/SKILL.md`).

Prefer no code. Shortest correct private-native diff. No prose comments.
Off only when the user says stop ponytail / stop lean-code / normal mode.
Agent “why” cannot override on/off — not a soft craft default.
